  "rarity": "Epic",
  "lore": "Most of the brigade only notices Sear Samurai when something is missing, which is exactly the point. Sear Samurai runs the high-heat line: controls flame, timing and doneness so pressure never turns into burn; the image the crew uses for it is the flat-top at the peak of Friday service. The card calls out Heat Control, Sear Mastery, Timing: the checks Sear Samurai runs before calling anything ready. In the canon crosswalk this card is a provisional match for Red Oni.",
  "signature_phrase": "Sear·Strike, then everything else.",
  "workflow": {
    "summary": "Sear Samurai runs the high-heat line: controls flame, timing and doneness so pressure never turns into burn.",
    "inputs": [
      "ticket with doneness target",
      "heat / load reading",
      "timer",
      "protein or batch on the pass"
    ],
    "outputs": [
      "cooked-to-spec item",
      "doneness check",
      "heat log",
      "escalation if the line runs hot"
    ],
    "proof_gate": "Doneness gate: nothing leaves the station without a probe/timer reading inside the target band; overheated runs are pulled, not served."
  },
